      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Our results indicate that 7-oxo-PgI2 pretreatment may induce a long lasting cytoprotective effect by preventing ischemia induced intracellular potassium loss and sodium accumulation in myocardial cells of guinea pigs furthermore by protecting from ischemic ultrastructural changes as sarcomere shortening, mitochondrial swelling and irregularity of I, A and Z bands in the rabbit myocardium."},
